map::at
^warning: ignoring
--
Datatype declarations for structs reached through pointers are deferred until
the struct containing the pointer has been declared. Declaring them right
away let the declaration of adapter refer to the datatype of ring, which was
not named yet (map::at) or, once named, not declared yet (unknown sort).
